WEBVTT

00:00:00.801 --> 00:00:03.276
Now, the interviewer's side.

00:00:03.276 --> 00:00:07.959
Priya opens her schedule and sees today's interviews:

00:00:07.959 --> 00:00:11.141
who, which badge, and which attempt.

00:00:12.153 --> 00:00:13.824
Nothing unlocks too early.

00:00:13.824 --> 00:00:21.663
She can start ten minutes before, record the result once it begins, and mark a no-show only after waiting fifteen minutes.

00:00:22.676 --> 00:00:26.772
When it's over, she picks pass, retake later, or not cleared.

00:00:26.772 --> 00:00:31.876
She scores three skills, and writes feedback the student will actually read.

00:00:32.884 --> 00:00:38.796
If her plans change, she can move the interview to another free slot, or cancel it.

00:00:38.796 --> 00:00:43.284
She just has to say why, and the student and the team are told.

00:00:44.289 --> 00:00:46.409
Her availability is set once a week.

00:00:46.409 --> 00:00:51.709
And if a slot is too close for students to book, she can still open it up at short notice.
